Alumni Association Website Walkthrough
=====================================

Project Overview
----------------
- Framework: Laravel 11
- Admin CMS: Filament v3
- Frontend: Blade + Tailwind (CDN)
- Database (current .env): SQLite (database/database.sqlite)
- Upload disk: public (storage/app/public, served through /storage)

Main Commands to Access the Website
-----------------------------------
1. Open terminal in project folder:
   C:\Users\Admin\OneDrive\Documents\Alumni\alumni-association

2. Install dependencies (first time only):
   composer install

3. Ensure app key exists:
   php artisan key:generate

4. Create storage link (required for images/files):
   php artisan storage:link

5. Run migrations:
   php artisan migrate

6. Create admin user for CMS:
   php artisan make:filament-user

7. Start website:
   php artisan serve

8. Open in browser:
   - Public site: http://127.0.0.1:8000
   - Admin panel: http://127.0.0.1:8000/admin

